# CVEs blocked on upstream image rebuilds — every entry MUST carry an exp:
# date so the ignore lapses and CI goes red again if upstream still hasn't
# shipped. Do not add entries without an expiry.

# Debian 12 shipped patched openssl (3.0.19/3.0.20-1~deb12u2) in early July
# 2026, but gcr.io/distroless/* has not been rebuilt against it yet. Affects
# libssl3 in all three images (api, web, ml-service).
CVE-2026-31789 exp:2026-08-08
CVE-2026-28387 exp:2026-08-08
CVE-2026-28388 exp:2026-08-08
CVE-2026-28389 exp:2026-08-08
CVE-2026-28390 exp:2026-08-08
CVE-2026-45447 exp:2026-08-08

